Changes, additions.
[list]
[*]Players are allowed to trade their goods for gold
[*]Now you need silver to start training any skill in the skill tree
[*]100% damaged buildings now are not destroyed. They acquire a state of "destroyed building". Everything what used to be in the upgrade slots, weapons and ammunition, collapses. The stock is removed outside the settlement (but not for the Flight Center, the Docking Port, the anti-aircraft towers in the wall and in the Fly Center, the Runway). The destroyed building can be repaired, also you can use its warehouse. The building in "destroyed" state live 72 real-hours, and then finally collapse;
[*]Reward for any activity (daily, weekly, personal achievement) is now awarded in silver coins;
[*]Capitals and Gnome Shop started to sell some elementary (blue) books;
[*]The settlement "Well" is now called "Alchemical factory" and can produce gunpowder in the alchemical workshops (besides all the goods it made before);
[*]The capacity of Margud's ship "Wanderer" was increased;
[*]The production of rocket launchers now requires the skill "Heavy weapons" level 1;
[*]Icons of "Bastions", Gnome Shop and the event's "Pirate Wars" icons were added to global map;
[/list]

