Changes in game mechanics, additions.
[list]
[*]New achievements and rewards.
[*]Introducing the new gnome modified mid-sized combat ship of the "Toad" project. It can be bought in Gnome Shop.
[*]When players sell resources to the NPC cities, those cities can then put them up for sale at higher price. For now this new feature is in test mode.
[*]Time required to produce "Torpedo engine" has been reduced.
[*]The distance to which a ship is transported, when using the «Leap» scroll, has been adjusted.
[*]The maneuverability of torpedoes has been improved. 
[/list]

Carrying capacity has been increased for the following ships: 
[list]
[*]Pilgrim to 120,000;
[*]Brawler to 150,000;
[*]Caper to 180,000;
[*]Corsair to 150,000;
[*]Dodger to 330,000;
[*]Tractor to 380,000;
[*]Wolf 150 to 520,000;
[*]Boar 150 to 580,000.
[/list]

Maximum altitude has been reduced for the following ships:
[list]
[*]Sutler balloon to 1,5 miles;
[*]Sutler Mk2 balloon to 1,5 miles;
[*]Shibay balloon to 1,5 miles;
[*]Shibay Mk2 balloon to 1,5 miles.  
[/list]

