Changes and bug fixes:
[list]
[*]Gold price in check book has been reduced;
[*]…that made licence for castles construction more expensive (this is relevant only to castles);
[*]Two new islands have appeared in the North, one of which has a new city called “Gnome Shop”. There you can buy basic resources from NPC sellers;
[*]The mechanic of aging buildings has changed. Lvl 1 buildings get completely dilapidated in one week, two weeks for lvl 2 buildings, lvl 3 buildings age as they did before, which is 4 weeks. This is relevant only to the settlements of general purpose (extracting buildings and castles are unaffected by the changes - they get old in 4 weeks);
[*]Durability of buildings in the settlements of general purpose has been increased 10 times;
[*]Damage dealt by missiles R-1 and RU-1 has been increased up to 100,000 with the range of 100 yards, missiles RSN-1 and RSNU-1 – up to 50,000 with the range of 50 yards;
[*]The ship Forwarder 200 now has a fuel tank of 500 tons instead of the previous 100;
[*]We have added new markers and hints to help the newcomers;
[*]…and we have slightly tweaked the interface as well, controlling the ship is easier now;
[*]From now we award the player 5 gold for every 30 minutes spent in the game (instead of 5 gold per hour)
[/list]
other minor improvements.

The update goes live at 11:00 am (UTC+0), Sept 15th 2016

Thank you, captains!

